# The Tor side of the fixture: a SOCKS port for the primary, and an onion
# service in front of the relay so that Tor has a way to reach it. Both are
# reachable on the fixture network only; nothing is published to the host.
DataDirectory /onion/state
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050
HiddenServiceDir /onion/relay
HiddenServicePort 2114 relay:2114
Log notice stdout
